{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2228","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2228/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2228/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2228/events","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/2228","id":41615678,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0MTYxNTY3OA==","number":2228,"title":"Final result ignored when chord is the penultimate task (using apply_async)","user":{"login":"aneilbaboo","id":2592723,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTI3MjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2592723?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo","html_url":"https://github.com/aneilbaboo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aneilbaboo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":226428149,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY0MjgxNDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Component:%20Canvas","name":"Component: Canvas","color":"f7c6c7","default":false,"description":null},{"id":226795379,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjY3OTUzNzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Status:%20Has%20Testcase%20%E2%9C%94","name":"Status: Has Testcase ✔","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":235024002,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzUwMjQwMDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/labels/Issue%20Type:%20Bug%20Report","name":"Issue Type: Bug Report","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2014-09-01T07:57:51Z","updated_at":"2015-07-14T06:56:52Z","closed_at":"2015-07-14T06:56:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When a chain contains a chord as its penultimate task, such as\n\n``` python\nmy_chord = group(task1.s(),task1.s()) | task2.s() \nmy_chain = my_chord | task3.s()\nresult = my_chain.apply_async().get()\n```\n\nThe result returned is the result of my_chord, not my_chain.  Note that this bug only shows up when using apply_async.  Synchronous application works fine.  I saw this bug with celery 3.1.13 using the redis backend.\n### tasks.py\n\n``` python\nimport operator\nfrom celery import Celery\nimport celeryconfig\n\napp = Celery('tasks')\napp.config_from_object(celeryconfig)\n\n@app.task\ndef add_list(lst):\n    res = reduce(operator.__add__,lst)\n    print(\"add_list({0})={1}\".format(lst,res))\n    return res\n\n@app.task\ndef add(a, b):\n    res = a + b\n    print(\"add(%d,%d)=%d\" % (a,b,res))\n    return res\n\n\n@app.task\ndef mul(a, b):\n    res = a * b\n    print(\"mul(%d,%d)=%d\" %(a,b,res))\n    return res\n```\n### tests.py\n\n``` python\nfrom tasks import add, add_list, mul\n\nclass TestApplyAsync(TestCase):\n    def test_chord_chain_one_task(self):\n        c = (group([add.si(2, 2), add.si(4, 4)])\n             | add_list.s()\n             | mul.s(2))\n        res = c.apply_async()\n        self.assertEqual(res.get(), 24)\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"thedrow","id":48936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow","html_url":"https://github.com/thedrow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thedrow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2228/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/2228/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}